  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hei Bai tells Hei Cheng that he still needs Hei Lou Lan to enter Imperial Court and find Immortal Gu Wooden Chicken in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building.",
        "chapters": [
          528
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_bai",
          "char_hei_cheng",
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "loc_imperial_court",
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Bai blames Xue Song Zi for fighting him over wooden chicken Gu, saying the Immortal Gu escaped its bindings and that he would already have held it otherwise. Hei Cheng answers that obtaining wooden chicken Gu through Eighty-Eight True Yang Building would still serve, and that once Hei Bai obtains it he will become an expert among Gu Immortals immediately.",
        "chapters": [
          543
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "escaped-bindings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_xue_song_zi",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Narration later states that Immortal Gu Wooden Chicken escaped Xue Song Zi and Hei Bai’s pursuit, then was still captured by Eighty-Eight True Yang Building.",
        "chapters": [
          596
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "escaped-bindings",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan notes that Eighty-Eight True Yang Building has formed about sixty floors and that Hei Lou Lan is attacking the thirty-ninth floor at full force, with wooden chicken Gu as the apparent target.",
        "chapters": [
          590
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "floor-thirty-nine-reward",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wooden chicken Gu sits on that thirty-ninth floor as the reward for its final round. Hei Lou Lan leads the breakthrough of the hundredth round that evening and obtains rank six Immortal Gu Wooden Chicken, then uses it to lure Xue Song Zi into helping him.",
        "chapters": [
          594
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "floor-thirty-nine-reward",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When formless hands break Hei Lou Lan’s strength path killer move, wooden chicken Gu is among the Immortal Gu seized from him, together with false emotion fake will Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          630
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "seizure-inside-the-building",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_false_emotion_fake_will_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited chapter names Wooden Chicken Gu’s path or a concrete activation effect beyond holding it as an Immortal Gu prize and bargaining chip.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "seizure-inside-the-building",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
